#. ~ MOD name
#: modinfo.json
msgid "Home Start"
msgstr "家中开局"

#. ~ MOD description
#: modinfo.json
msgid "Start the Cataclysm in your own flat on an upper floor of a downtown apartment tower.  You wake up next to your bed in a fitting set of clothes and a crowbar is waiting on the bedside furniture, so a locked door is never a dead end.  Your floor has been cleared of monsters; the streets outside have not.  Everything else in the flat is yours to loot."
msgstr "在市中心一栋公寓楼的高层醒来：你穿着一套合身的衣服，从床边起身，床边家具上放着一根撬棍（免得被锁在门里出不去）。你所在的这层楼已清空了怪物，外面的街道则没有。其余东西随你搜刮。"

#. ~ Scenario name (male)
#: scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Home Start"
msgstr "家中开局"

#. ~ Scenario name (female)
#: scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Home Start"
msgstr "家中开局"

#. ~ Scenario description (male)
#: scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "On the day of the Cataclysm you ran home through the crowds in the street.  You threw the door shut so hard that the key snapped off in the lock, leaving half of it stuck in the door, but at least you made it inside.\n\nFor the next few days you ran a low fever and drifted through them: you grabbed something to eat when you were hungry, drank a little water when you were thirsty, and slept away most of the rest.\n\nBy the time you finally came to your senses, it was already another world outside."
msgstr "大灾变那天，你从街上的人潮里一路跑回自己的家。反手锁门时手上用力太猛——钥匙\"咔\"地断在了锁孔里，半截卡在门上，不过好在你还是设法进了屋。\n\n之后几天你发着低烧，浑浑噩噩地过：饿了摸点东西吃，渴了喝口水，剩下的时间几乎都在睡。\n\n等你彻底清醒过来，外面已经是另一个世界了。"

