msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You fled home from the street on the day of the Cataclysm and snapped the key off in the lock getting the door shut.  You have spent the days since in a low fever, drifting in and out of it: something to eat when you were hungry, a little water when you were thirsty.  By the time you came to your senses, it was another world outside."
msgstr "大灾变那天你从街上逃回自己家，反手锁门时把钥匙拧断在锁孔里。之后几天你发着低烧，浑浑噩噩地过——饿了摸点东西吃，渴了喝口水。等你彻底清醒，外面已经是另一个世界。"

