#. ~ Start popup message
#: eocs.json
msgid "You sit up in bed, your head still swimming.\n\nOutside the window, there are more of them than there were a few days ago."
msgstr "你从床上坐起来，头还有点晕。\n\n窗外，它们比前几天更多了。"
